  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to handle an enemy when none of your allies is closer.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot\" title=\"Point-Blank Shot\">Point-Blank Shot</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> If none of your allies are closer to your target than you are when you make a ranged attack, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to the attack roll. Your target must be at Short <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a> or closer to gain this bonus.</p>",
